to them. It really makes people

00:29:08.020 --> 00:29:11.260
feel empowered. And I think that
is a positive result from this

00:29:11.260 --> 00:29:15.130
project. So I think it's
important to consider if a goal

00:29:15.130 --> 00:29:18.040
is the final narrative itself,
or if the goal is for the

00:29:18.040 --> 00:29:20.980
process of creating to be
impactful. And that can kind of

00:29:20.980 --> 00:29:24.250
help you decide the balance of
director versus participant.

00:29:25.570 --> 00:29:27.940
And another thing that I've
realized through this work

00:29:27.940 --> 00:29:30.250
that's kind of interesting, and
I hadn't really considered at

00:29:30.250 --> 00:29:34.420
